Admission follows the standard process set out under the South African Schools Act, with registration for the following year''s intake typically opening between April and October and specific age requirements for Grade R and Grade 1 entry. The school currently has an enrolment of around 884 learners taught by about 31 educators. Based in La Montagne, Pretoria, it serves families in the surrounding suburb looking for an established, fee-paying public primary school.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://schoolsdigest.co.za/listings/la-montagne-primary-school/', '$[#]', 'https://www.school-register.co.za/school/la-montagne-primary-school/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'la-montagne-primary-school-la-montagne' AND description = 'La Montagne Primary School is a fee-charging public primary school in La Montagne covering Grades R-7 within the Tshwane South education district, with an enrolment of around 884 learners and 31 educators.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
